    "modelProviderCapabilities": "The inspected response bounds imageGeneration, namespaceTools, and webSearch; it is not a Desktop built-in tool registry.",
    "queue": "thread/queue/add is in the experimental schema and requires threadId, input, and clientUserMessageId. Cross-process wake and deduplication were not tested.",
    "nativeParentage": "ThreadStartParams exposes no parentThreadId. Preserve Nelos parentage separately from native thread/session identity."
